WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Start with the right details and make the
next step easy to follow.

00:00:04.150 --> 00:00:07.100
Pull up the original order and item or
cabinet details. Describe the exact part
and

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.050
how many you need.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:14.225
Use the factory's current request form and
include any photos, video or delivery and

00:00:14.225 --> 00:00:17.850
installation records the request calls for.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.965
Ask the factory to confirm how the request
will be handled, including any coverage,

00:00:22.965 --> 00:00:27.530
charges and timing. Share those details
with the customer as they are confirmed.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:32.400
Your team prepares, submits and follows the
routine request. Keep the factory's reply

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.720
and next follow-up with the job. Bring your
rep in when something is unusual, stuck,

00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:41.040
urgent or putting the customer relationship
at risk.
